   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've passed your case to a specialist, and they'll follow up within 24 hours. I included the false \"delivered\" mark at 6:58 PM, when the courier was 2.1 miles away. I also noted that the handoff happened at 7:47 PM and that you'd like someone to look into why. They have your phone number, 415-555-0232. I can't promise what they'll decide.\n\nThe $5.60 credit stays on your account. I'm sorry again for the experience, Leo."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Fine, thanks for passing it on. I'd still like to know why the app marked it delivered when I was sitting there waiting, so hopefully the specialist can answer that. Keep the $5.60, I'm not going to use it on a dinner I've already paid for."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've noted that you want an answer on why the app marked the order delivered. The specialist has that in the case notes.\n\nThe $5.60 credit will stay on your account in case you change your mind. It's only usable on future orders. I'm sorry again for the late dinner, Leo."
